        "text": "# Server Failure\n\nA **server failure** occurs when the computer (server) hosting a website stops functioning correctly. \n\nUnlike a network failure where the \"path\" is broken, in a server failure, your request might reach the destination, but the server is unable to process the data or send a response.",
